  "data_asof": "2026-11-14",
  "key_points": [
    "Revenue is growing, and it comes from Intents. NEAR's protocol revenue in Oct 2026 was 5.2\u00d7 its level a year earlier. Intents earned 95% of protocol revenue over Aug 2026\u2013Oct 2026, against 34% a year earlier.",
    "NEAR AI is small but growing fast. It served 225.2B tokens on OpenRouter in the week to Nov 8, 2026, 16\u00d7 its first full week, and customers have staked 1.5M NEAR to pay for it.",
    "Burns and buybacks tie that revenue to the token. They offset 19.5% of new NEAR in 2026 Q3, up from 1.8% a year earlier. If Intents revenue keeps growing at a fading rate, they offset all of it by Dec 2028.",
    "Staking locks NEAR up. On Nov 14, 2026, 45.0% of all NEAR was staked to secure the L1, and 1.5M NEAR was staked with NEAR AI, which opened staking for AI credits on Jul 30, 2026."
  ]
